cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use iEEGLAB, please cite it as below, and also cite the methods you
  used (CARLA, CRP, N1 detection) - the plugin prints the relevant reference
  each time a method runs.
title: "iEEGLAB: an EEGLAB plugin for intracranial EEG and CCEP analysis"
type: software
